{"4316420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spacebound Sprint", "steam_appid": 4316420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacebound Sprint</strong> is a fast-paced 3D action platformer where you control a small robot in futuristic arenas packed with traps, enemies, and constant danger. Every level is a race against the clock: you have <strong>80 seconds</strong> to survive, move with precision, and reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t stand still. Jumping, dodging, and reacting quickly are the keys to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏱ Time-Based Challenges</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level must be completed before time runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have <strong>80 seconds</strong> — speed and precision are everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick thinking is just as important as fast movement</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 Varied Enemies and Hazards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll face:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers that block paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying orbs that fire projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushing walls that punish mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mines that chase you for a short time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each threat demands a different reaction and strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹 Skill-Based 3D Platforming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise jumps across circular arenas suspended in space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agile movement with a sense of inertia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning and reading the environment are essential</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 Futuristic Space Arenas</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments floating in the vacuum of space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design focused on risk and constant movement</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 Increasing Difficulty</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemies and traps appear as you advance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage demands better control, faster reflexes, and smarter decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Normal” mode and “Hard” mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for <strong>controller</strong> play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also fully playable with <strong>keyboard and mouse</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 What Kind of Experience to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct, fast action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but intense challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gameplay focused on reflexes and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small mistakes can cost you the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t slow exploration — it’s constant tension in arenas built to push you to your limits.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacebound Sprint</strong> is a fast-paced 3D action platformer where you control a small robot in futuristic arenas packed with traps, enemies, and constant danger. Every level is a race against the clock: you have <strong>80 seconds</strong> to survive, move with precision, and reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t stand still. Jumping, dodging, and reacting quickly are the keys to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏱ Time-Based Challenges</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level must be completed before time runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have <strong>80 seconds</strong> — speed and precision are everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick thinking is just as important as fast movement</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 Varied Enemies and Hazards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll face:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers that block paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying orbs that fire projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushing walls that punish mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mines that chase you for a short time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each threat demands a different reaction and strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹 Skill-Based 3D Platforming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise jumps across circular arenas suspended in space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agile movement with a sense of inertia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning and reading the environment are essential</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 Futuristic Space Arenas</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments floating in the vacuum of space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design focused on risk and constant movement</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 Increasing Difficulty</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemies and traps appear as you advance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage demands better control, faster reflexes, and smarter decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Normal” mode and “Hard” mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for <strong>controller</strong> play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also fully playable with <strong>keyboard and mouse</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 What Kind of Experience to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct, fast action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but intense challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gameplay focused on reflexes and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small mistakes can cost you the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t slow exploration — it’s constant tension in arenas built to push you to your limits.</p>", "short_description": "SPACEBOUND SPRINT is a fast-paced 3D platformer where every second counts. Race against the clock, dodge deadly traps, smash walls, and destroy hostile robots to reach the goal. Use items and power-ups to overcome tough obstacles and push your skills to the limit.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316420/e7ba8460dce499281ca283e4c3c733a6d54cd344/header.jpg?t=1772230445", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316420/9658c6fd53140db8b7a95747b9c222c00156ea3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772230445", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316420/9658c6fd53140db8b7a95747b9c222c00156ea3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772230445", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.0 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics compatible with DirectX 11 (Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space<b